\end{aligned}

Now, electric field, $E=-\frac{d V}{d r}$
Here, $V=A r^2+B$
\begin{array}{ll}
\therefore & E=-\frac{d V}{d r}=-2 A r+0=-2 A r \\
\therefore & \rho=\frac{3 E \varepsilon_0}{r}
\end{array}

=\frac{3\left(-2 A r \cdot \varepsilon_0\right)}{r}=-6 A \varepsilon_0

